Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:31.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再排一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's rehearse again everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:32.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shut the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:37.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}集中注意力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Concentrate please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:40.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都准备好了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready everybody?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:43.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:48.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快动啊 进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well go on! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.15,0:02:02.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}够了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's enough everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.21,0:02:03.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蠢蛋们 都住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop you idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.93,0:02:07.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.17,0:02:15.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们知不知道 这戏得花多少银子？嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you any idea of the cost of this production?Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:19.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们真的妄想 国王陛下乐意花一"小"笔钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you truly imagine his majesty will be happy to spend a small fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.83,0:02:24.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就为了这么"大"场面的鸡飞狗跳 ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on such a large shambles!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:27.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}刚那枪谁打的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who fired that musket ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.06,0:02:33.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该是我吧 康尼士先生 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think I did, mr.Cornish, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:39.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:44.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要是娱乐不了特使们 你就直接朝他们开枪好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you can't entertain the envoys, then you're going to shoot them instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:47.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是这样的吗？嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that it?! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:52.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.57,0:02:55.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有事让你做 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have some business for you, charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:57.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谨遵吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:03:00.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要把妹妹玛格丽特 许配给葡萄牙国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My sister margaret is to marry the king of portugal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:04.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要你护送她和嫁妆至里斯本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to escort her and her dowry to lisbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}代表我送她出嫁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and give her away in my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.07,0:03:07.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么是我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.61,0:03:09.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要能放心的人来做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need someone I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:12.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把一个漂亮女人放心交给我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You trust me with a beautiful woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.81,0:03:14.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把我妹妹交给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:17.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当然放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.12,0:03:19.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么不放心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why shouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:23.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管怎么样 你都已经订婚了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In any case, you're already betrothed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:27.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟谁来着？一时记不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what's her name? I can't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:28.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白-格雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Elizabeth grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:30.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是多塞特侯爵的堂妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's the cousin of the marquess of dorset.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:34.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:38.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能受陛下信任深感荣幸 但还有一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm honoured by your majesty's trust but there is still a difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:41.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以我卑微的身份怎可为国王的妹妹送嫁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not important enough to give away the sister of a king
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:43.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更别说是英格兰国王的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}let alone the king of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:47.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我将封你为公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's why I'm making you a duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:49.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨福克公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Duke of suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:52.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如何啊大人 满意吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How does that please your grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:58.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:02.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇帝向国王致以最美好的祝愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The emperor sends his best wishes to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.21,0:04:05.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们非常感谢您 摩尔先生 谢谢您亲自迎接我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are most grateful to you, mr.More, for coming to welcome us in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:08.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 这是我的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, it's my honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:11.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下把二位的到访 当作伟大的时刻一般看待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty regards your visit as a thing of great moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:15.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们何时得以会见国王陛下呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When shall we have an audience with his majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.20,0:04:17.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给二位阁下一句建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me advise your excellencies on this:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:20.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一条路能传达意向至国王耳中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is only one way to reach the king's ear,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.35,0:04:23.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是通过沃尔西主教的协助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that is through the good offices of cardinal wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:28.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有传言说 摩尔先生 主教他比较维护法国的利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We heard some rumours, mr.More, that the cardinal advocates french interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.11,0:04:31.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有他认为 那些也是我们的利益时才会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only when he considers them to be in ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:34.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请告诉我 皇帝陛下对路德异教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me: What is the emperor's attitude
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.13,0:04:37.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他领土上的崛起有何态度？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the rise of the lutheran heresy in some of his territories?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.89,0:04:42.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我朋友伊拉斯默斯告诉我 在德国 这个异教有着燎原之势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My friend erasmus tells me that in germany it's spreading like a forest fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:45.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下用尽全力镇压这股势力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His highness does everything in his power to suppress it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:48.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但如您所知 路德本人 是德国王子们的客人之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But, as you know, luther himself is the guest of one of the german princes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.81,0:04:51.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很不幸地 超出他的掌控之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unfortunately beyond his control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:55.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我国王正撰写一本小册子 抨击路德那些邪恶言论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My king is writing a pamphlet demolishing luther's arguments,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:59.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}保卫教皇制度和我们的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}defending the papacy and our faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:06.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说 他亲自动笔写 亲手书写这本书？不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mean, he is writing it himself, with his own hand?No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.09,0:05:12.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我国王所能之事不计其数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are a great many things that my king can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:21.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝特使到 主教阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The envoys from the emperor, your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:23.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}二位阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your excellencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:26.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有朋自远方来 不亦乐乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is indeed a happy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.39,0:05:30.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了表示对你们的来访热烈欢迎 我们准备了许多庆典活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have planned many festivities in honour of this most welcome visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:33.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我诚挚的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it is my devout hope and wish
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:36.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们能共同完成协议的细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that together, we can finalize the details of a treaty
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:40.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这协议将使得我们两国的君主 友谊长存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which will bind your master and mine in perpetual friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:43.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们也如此衷心希望 主教阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is very much our hope too, your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:47.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:51.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你别来 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not you, thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:57.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想浪费二位和我自己的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't want to waste your time, or mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:06:00.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在畅饮之前 请告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So before we drink, tell me:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:05.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇帝陛下对这协议是否真诚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is the emperor in fact sincere about this treaty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:09.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 毫无疑问是的 - 那好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  Of course he is. -  Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:11.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一定尽力巩固这项大事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I propose to cement it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:14.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时我们将宣布 将我国王之女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We also announce the betrothal of the emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:17.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽公主 许配皇帝陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the daughter of the king, princess mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.05,0:06:20.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据我们理解 公主已经与法国皇太子订婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is our understanding that she is already betrothed to the dauphin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.77,0:06:24.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但现在她被许给查尔斯殿下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now she will be betrothed to charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:27.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非二位有异议？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unless you have some other objection?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:30.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 并没有 - 好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  On the contrary. -  Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:34.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么共识达成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇帝陛下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The emperor...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:46.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}命我们私下转告主教阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}told us to inform your eminence personally
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:54.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望您能接受他赠予您的 非常丰厚的一笔抚恤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he wishes to bestow upon you a very generous pension.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:07:03.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他亦将全力支持您当上教皇的雄心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will also throw his weight behind your ambitions to be pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:07.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为二位阁下成功来访干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us drink to the success of your excellencies' visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:12.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.43,0:07:15.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找到方法让我甥女出现在国王眼前了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have found some means to put my niece before the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.93,0:07:18.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 大人 都安排好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, your grace. Already arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:21.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安 会出现在给特使安排的表演中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne is to appear in the pageant for the spanish envoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:23.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下也会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As is the king.*Framlinghan Castle, A Residence of the Duke of Norfolk*
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.49,0:07:26.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她会有办法吸引他注意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She will find a way to draw his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:27.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:34.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当她为他张开双腿 就能张嘴除掉沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When she opens her legs for him, she can open her mouth and denounce wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:41.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确有种说法 最锋锐的利刃藏在最柔软的袋子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They do say that the sharpest blades are sheathed in the softest pouches.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:57.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红衣主教沃尔西阁下及西班牙大使 门多萨和查姆普伊斯大人到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His eminence, cardinal wolsey and the spanish ambassadors mendoza and champuis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些女士们是什么人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are those ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:38.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们是美德女神 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are the graces,excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:44.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们名叫善 荣 坚 慈及悯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have names like kindness, honour,constance,mercy and pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.66,0:08:46.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们被囚禁在城堡中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are prisoners in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:50.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}左边那位 站在破碎的心下方的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The figure to the left, under the broken hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:55.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}便是国王陛下的妹妹 玛格丽特公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is his majesty's sister, princess margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是谁囚禁了她们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who is keeping them prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:58.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:08:59.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}妒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jealousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:00.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unkindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.59,0:09:01.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嘲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Scorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:05.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鄙 怪 等等…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Disdain. Strangeness...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:14.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王也在其中？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is the king there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.93,0:09:16.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是哪一位？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which one is the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:20.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}男人们代表年轻 奉献 忠诚 意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The men represent youth,devotion, loyalty,pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}风度… 自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentleness...liberty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:26.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且是的 国王陛下就隐藏其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And,yes,his majesty is hid amongst them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:35.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为热望之化身 我要求你们释放被囚之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As ardent desire, I demand you release your prisoners!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:39.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为嘲之女神 我嘲笑你的热望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As lady scorn,I laugh at your desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.67,0:09:43.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你眼前的男士们都是显赫的贵族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These men are noble lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:47.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 他们只是盛装的普通人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,they're just men dressed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:48.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我重复一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I say it again:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:52.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放了这些 被如此残酷囚禁的美好少女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Release these fair damsels that you keep so cruelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:55.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}休想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:58.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么我们别无选择 只有攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You give us no choice but to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:10:01.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}撕裂你们的防御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and breach your defenses!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:06.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何骑士都不可能撕裂我的"防御"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No knight shall ever breach mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.81,0:10:13.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士 热望压倒一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady,desire overcomes all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:17.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:35.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坚守女神 你是我的囚犯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perseverance, you are my prisoner now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:45.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:47.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:30.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 全体取下面罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now all shall be unmasked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:14.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得跟你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:17.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信你已经处理好你那些关系了 玛格丽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trust you've settled all your affairs here,margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.73,0:12:19.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:20.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}(葡萄牙)国王已经来信 表达对你的爱慕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the king has written of his love for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.59,0:12:25.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}见过你的画像后 更迫不及待想见你真人一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and has eagerness to set eyes on you, having seen your portrait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:32.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你 我是你妹妹 别把我嫁给那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I plead with you,as your sister, don't make me marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:35.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他那么老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's an old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.27,0:12:49.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:54.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是安-博林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:27.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 康尼士大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,master cornish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:29.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm very grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.86,0:13:32.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯大人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir,thomas...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:49.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能与你的主子见面吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}may I see your mistress?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.57,0:13:58.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位先生求见 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A gentleman,my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:03.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰登先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr.Brandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:06.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你还没有荣升公爵吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are not yet invested a duke, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:09.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还没有 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:14.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要带200随从到葡萄牙去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall be taking with me,to portugal, a company of 200 persons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.76,0:14:20.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}包括我的管家 牧师 洗衣工 还有我所有侍女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They shall include my chamberlain,my chaplain, my laundress,all of my ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.69,0:14:21.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:25.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有任何事情需要讨论的 你可以跟管家谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should you have anything to discuss, you may do so with my chamberlain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.48,0:14:26.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:32.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很惊讶 王兄居然选了一位 没有贵族血统的人来代表他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am surprised my brother chose a man without noble blood to represent hiM.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.96,0:14:36.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算是诺福克都好些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even norfolk would have been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:53.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}佩斯先生 王后陛下准备好会见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr.Pace,the queen is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.30,0:14:56.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请待我通报王后二位的到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will announce you to the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:15:01.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿拉贡的凯瑟琳陛下 英格兰王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her majesty katherine of aragon, queen of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.08,0:15:08.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 西班牙特使到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty,the envoys from spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.44,0:15:15.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你们跟国王约定了会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I konw you have an audience with the king
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:18.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是无法错过与你们见面的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just couldn't let you pass without seeing you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:20.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:24.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的侄儿 罗马帝国皇帝 向您传达对您的爱及长久的祝愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your nephew the emperor sends you his love and fillial regards always
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:27.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟他说 如果他爱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell him, if he loves me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.45,0:15:30.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就该多些来信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he should write to more often
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:33.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我从心底感到欢乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I happy from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.07,0:15:35.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们能来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you are here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.79,0:15:40.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能够签订一项和平协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that there is going to be a treaty
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:47.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当心红衣主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just beware the Cardinal
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.48,0:15:55.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下即刻接见二位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty will receive you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:04.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 欢迎来到我的王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen,welcome to my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:08.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道两位的努力谈判会成功 一项圆满的协议将会达成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you will succeed in your efforts to negotiate a successful treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:12.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请相信红衣主教沃尔西的每句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may trust everything cardinal wolsey says.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:17.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在所有事项上 他是我的直接代言人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He speaks for me directly in all matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:20.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为我本人 我希望邀请皇帝陛下来访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As for my part I should like to invite the emperor to visit here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:23.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}越快越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as soon as can be arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.43,0:16:29.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的来访将会给我 我的王后 带来无上的喜悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The visit would give pleasure both to me, to my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.06,0:16:31.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:47.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他几时来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When's he coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:48.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本月末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The end of this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:50.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么快？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:52.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若是他需要攻打法兰西的盟友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he needs allies for his attack on the french,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.07,0:16:54.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那即是说有意在近期进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that can only mean he intends to do so very shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:55.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:57.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}使节私下告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The envoys told me in confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:17:01.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}西班牙国王将首先进攻法占意大利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the emperor will strike first against the french occupation in italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.81,0:17:04.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他持米兰公国的所有权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has a claim to the duchy of milan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:05.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:09.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在您的帮助下 将法国人逐出意大利后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then,having driven them out of italy, with your help
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.76,0:17:13.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他将攻打法国本土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he will invade france itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.03,0:17:19.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}集结所有军队参加联合进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to prepare all our forces for a joint invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:20.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:23.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有 再造一艘军舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I want another warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:27.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下 凯旋号才下水不久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty,we have only just launched the victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:30.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下单再造一艘 一艘更大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then order another one,a greater one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.69,0:17:35.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}缺少士兵 可用战船替代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What we lack in men we can more than make up for in ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:37.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教 我们是岛国民族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're an island race,cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:39.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拥有着世界上最优秀最勇敢的海员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have the best and bravest sailors in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.65,0:17:41.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要造一支最强的海军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will have the greatest navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:44.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}军舰花费昂贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ships are expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:46.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲是个谨慎的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father was a careful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:49.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精明的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A shrewd man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:51.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更是个商人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A businessman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:55.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他留给我一大笔财产 主教阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He left me a great deal of money, your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.08,0:17:58.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我准备尽其所用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I intend to spend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.53,0:18:12.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:15.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯-博林爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir thomas boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:20.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:22.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.59,0:18:24.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:27.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我自觉有些怠慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feel I have been a little remiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:31.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于你为我做出的外交上的努力 我从未表示感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never showed my gratitude for all the diplomatic efforts you made on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:33.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下何需此言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty had no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:37.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我悉听陛下吩咐 尽我所能为您效劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am simply content to serve you, in whatever capacity I can be of use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:41.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管如此 还是要表示我的感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nevertheless, I wish to share my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.25,0:18:44.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我愿封你为嘉德爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It pleases me to make you a knight of the garter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:49.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时钦点你为王室的财务审检\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am also appointing you comptroller of my household.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:55.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕陛下高估了鄙人的才能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe your majesty has a greater opinion of my talents than I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.45,0:18:58.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这当由我来决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall be the judge of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.87,0:19:03.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迟些再议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall talk more later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:07.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 差点忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh. I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:10.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.11,0:19:12.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}参演了化装舞会的那个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The one who performed in our masquerade?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.39,0:19:13.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.39,0:19:15.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:21.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上 她很快便会入宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As a matter of fact, she is soon to come to court,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.59,0:19:25.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做皇后陛下的侍女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a ladyinwaiting to her majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.57,0:19:49.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}西弗城堡 博林一家居所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hever Castle Boleyn Family Home
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:51.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你将离我如此而去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And will you leave me thus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:54.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非 非 多么遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Say nay,say nay,for shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:19:59.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}换用我的悲叹 拯救你于责难？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To save you from the blame, of all my grief and grame?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:01.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你将离我这般而去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And will you leave me so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.64,0:20:05.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Say no,say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.01,0:20:08.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你将离我如此而去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And will you leave me thus
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.20,0:20:13.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}心中无处容他爱你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and have no more pity of he that loves thee?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:16.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唉 残忍的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alas,your cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:19.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你将离我这般而去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And will you leave me thus?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.24,0:20:23.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Say no,say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:30.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯… 喜欢吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well...do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:35.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道我该喜欢谴责我残忍的词段吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should I like something that accuses me of being cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:46.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真残忍 安女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are cruel,mistress anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:49.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.19,0:20:54.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能这么做 怀亚特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have no claim on me,master wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.37,0:20:57.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对所有的情人都是如此说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have the same claim as every other lover,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:20:59.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女人心天生自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to whom a woman's heart has been freely given.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.57,0:21:02.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是诗人 就如我是女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a poet,as I am a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.75,0:21:07.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诗人和女人的心总是自由的 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poets and women are always free with their hearts,are they not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.21,0:21:09.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:12.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下 汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop it,tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:15.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mustn'T.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.97,0:21:21.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来我是对的了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I was right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.82,0:21:31.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你意已绝 将离我而去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are leaving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.35,0:21:38.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么不回答？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why don't you answer me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:40.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:45.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 但是我们分居了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,but I'm separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:48.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就要离婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going to divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.21,0:21:51.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再说 有谁不是结婚了的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean,who isn't married?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:21:58.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今后不要再想来见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must never ask to see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.45,0:22:00.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能保证吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.72,0:22:03.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.45,0:22:07.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白这保证没什么意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I have just learned what promises are worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.89,0:22:09.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有别人了对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it another?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.22,0:22:11.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对不对？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:14.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你爱上了别人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you love another?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.89,0:22:20.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别再来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never ask of me,and never,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.55,0:22:22.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你自重的话 别对别人提及我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you value your life, speak of me to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.58,0:22:25.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明白了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.50,0:22:33.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就毫无怜悯之心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you no pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:40.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想象得出来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.07,0:22:42.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想象他现在会怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imagine what he's gonna be like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.96,0:22:46.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我打赌他下体已经按耐不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll wager he's already ordered a bigger codpiece!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.73,0:22:48.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:50.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.03,0:22:50.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我收集你的屁去换美酒 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me bottle up your farts and sell them for nectar,your grace.|不 阁下|No,your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.04,0:22:54.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我收集你的屁去换美酒 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me bottle up your farts and sell them for nectar,your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.49,0:22:56.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不要再想了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't want to think about it any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.91,0:22:59.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想起了都难受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It makes me ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.58,0:23:04.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们干吗好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.76,0:23:07.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Find women.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:12.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算她是纯洁无暇的女神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even if she was a complete venus,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.52,0:23:16.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这么垂头丧气 也满足不了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I couldn't satisfy her in my dejected state.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:19.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们就多喝点酒吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's just drink more then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.94,0:23:22.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.84,0:23:26.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}敬阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To his grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:28.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}敬查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here's to charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.32,0:23:31.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.42,0:23:37.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}使节是否载着好消息回去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did the envoys leave in good cheer?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.21,0:23:40.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们满怀欣喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were in excellent spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.39,0:23:43.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}条约已经签署\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The treaty is agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.83,0:23:46.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的侄子会来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my nephew will come?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.21,0:23:49.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等待消息吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We wait for news.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.31,0:23:52.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西会知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wolsey will find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.86,0:24:02.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我做了个梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.63,0:24:05.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在梦里 你又来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In my dream,you came to me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.31,0:24:07.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将我拥在怀中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and held me in your arms,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.72,0:24:15.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}轻声说一切都安好 万事都安好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you whispered that all would be well and all manner of things would be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.49,0:24:21.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.45,0:24:23.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.56,0:24:26.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.94,0:24:29.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一定要相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.39,0:24:34.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未那般的… 亲近过你的皇兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never knew your brother,in that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.60,0:24:35.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他当时那么年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.51,0:24:38.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么虚弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he was ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.36,0:24:46.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未亲近其他男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have never known another man,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.06,0:24:49.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不想亲近其他男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nor ever want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.31,0:24:55.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.47,0:25:42.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.90,0:25:59.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去房间里见国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Won't you join the king in his chambers?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.23,0:26:19.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.30,0:26:23.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的爱女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My darling daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.16,0:26:30.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阳光小姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.58,0:26:32.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你做祷告了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you said your prayers?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.35,0:26:35.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.58,0:26:58.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.01,0:27:05.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样您喜欢吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How like you this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.41,0:27:29.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王可有什么消息或者迹象说 今晚可能会来看我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Has the king sent any message or sign that he might visit me tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.12,0:27:31.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.98,0:27:57.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很担心你 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,worried about you,my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.56,0:28:02.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你工作得太辛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You work too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.92,0:28:05.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.55,0:28:11.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样会让你丧命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.91,0:28:15.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.66,0:28:18.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.97,0:28:23.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.48,0:28:38.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aren't you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.09,0:28:39.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.11,0:28:41.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇后的新侍女到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The queen's new ladies have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.19,0:28:43.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.70,0:28:57.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.76,0:28:59.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.28,0:29:02.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看她走路的样子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The way she carries herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.10,0:29:07.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"这就如剧毒的毒蛇一般 竟然把圣城罗马称作巴比伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"What serpent was ever so venomous as to call the holy city of rome babylon...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.87,0:29:10.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把教皇的权威称作暴政\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the pope's authority tyranny,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.95,0:29:16.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把神圣的神父蔑称为反基督徒？"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}turned the name of our holy father into antichrist?"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.08,0:29:18.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.03,0:29:21.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}言辞激烈 但是很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Strongly worded,but it's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.58,0:29:22.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.84,0:29:27.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许言辞可以稍微温和一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well you might think of toning down the polemic just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.24,0:29:32.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比如你把路德叫做"杂种"的这地方 到哪儿去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For example,where you describe luther as "this weed",where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.08,0:29:37.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里 "这丧心病狂的孬种"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"This dilapidated, sick and evilminded sheep."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.67,0:29:39.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}温和一点？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tone it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.39,0:29:41.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊 出于…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well yes,for...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.98,0:29:43.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出于外交策略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for diplomatic purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.96,0:29:46.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,never.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.21,0:29:48.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谴责路德怎么说都不过分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No language can be strong enough to condemn luther,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.30,0:29:52.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赞扬他却是无话可说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nor gracious enough to praise his holiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.59,0:29:56.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会为他准备一份副本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will dedicate a copy to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.45,0:29:59.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到罗马去交给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you will take it to him,in rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.99,0:30:01.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么是我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.23,0:30:06.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果其中有任何一丝真善之处 都是因为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If there is anything true and good in it, it is due to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.48,0:30:10.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果没有你的指导和忠诚 托马斯-摩尔爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could never have written it or anything else, sir thomas more,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.64,0:30:14.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是永远也无法写出此慷慨之言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}without your guidance and unfailing honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.50,0:30:17.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您为什么叫我托马斯爵士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you call me sir thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.59,0:30:19.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我所能做的 只能是你封爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A knighthood is the least I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.54,0:30:21.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我所做的还不值得如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a great deal more than I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.39,0:30:24.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要太谦逊了 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now,don't be too modest,thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.68,0:30:27.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不是圣人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not a saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.66,0:30:33.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还有别的事要托付你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is something else I want you to do for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.22,0:30:38.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收缴所有能找到的路德的作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seize all the copies of luther's works you can find
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.26,0:30:41.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}烧掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.20,0:30:44.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全部烧掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Burn them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.91,0:30:58.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国来信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From france.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.70,0:31:28.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯国王已经发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,king francis has already discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.18,0:31:31.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们和西班牙恢复邦交了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}our rapprochement with the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.38,0:31:37.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他觉得被背叛 很生气 并为此威胁我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He feels betrayed and angry and is making threats against our interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.38,0:31:40.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁告诉他的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who told him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.87,0:31:48.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣保罗十字街 伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}*********
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.47,0:32:13.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.56,0:32:37.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士们先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lords and ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.28,0:32:41.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣罗马帝国皇帝 阿拉贡 巴伦西亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his imperial highness,charles,holy roman emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.01,0:32:44.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不勒斯及西西里之国王 查尔斯殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}king of aragon,valencia,naples and sicily.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.75,0:32:46.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勃艮第公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Duke of burgundian territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.77,0:32:50.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奥地利大公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Archduke of austria.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.29,0:33:02.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教阁下 稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eminence,a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.91,0:33:05.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走开 佩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move away,mr.Pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.07,0:33:07.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.18,0:33:09.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 主教阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.40,0:33:12.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.29,0:33:16.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.30,0:33:20.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没料到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not expect...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.83,0:33:23.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我忍受不了等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not sustain the anticipation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.27,0:33:26.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以直接下来迎接您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had to come straight down and welcome you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.81,0:33:29.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真是万分荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I am truly honoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.14,0:33:30.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bienvenidos.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.90,0:33:33.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚我们就跳舞狂欢吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tonight we shall dance and feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.03,0:33:36.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天 带你去看看我的舰队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And tomorrow,you shall come see my ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.39,0:33:37.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.78,0:33:38.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奏乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Music!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.85,0:33:40.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庆祝吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.29,0:33:42.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.18,0:33:49.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把那个人带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remove that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.97,0:33:57.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.66,0:33:58.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.50,0:34:00.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.69,0:34:06.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 佩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah,mr.Pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.36,0:34:13.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一定获悉国王陛下的突然来访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You knew,of course,that his majesty was going to make this surprise visit
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.54,0:34:14.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.39,0:34:15.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.35,0:34:17.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是他的秘书 当然知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As his secretary I would obviously know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.28,0:34:18.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊 你当然知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,of course you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.85,0:34:20.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然你也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you also knew of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.33,0:34:26.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇帝的特使曾经秘密到访 想和陛下签署条约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the imperial envoys had come,privately, to make a treaty with his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.41,0:34:29.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 你也说西班牙文 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But then of course, you speak spanish,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.72,0:34:33.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如你的法文一样流利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Almost as well as you speak french.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.12,0:34:35.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我 呃…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.01,0:34:36.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不明白主教大人您的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't understand your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.98,0:34:38.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为你心知肚明 佩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think you do,mr.Pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.36,0:34:39.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真得如此认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I really think you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.91,0:34:42.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为你看 我认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because you see,I think
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.11,0:34:48.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不单替我做眼线 你还替法国人做间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you not only spy for me you also spy for the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.33,0:34:50.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.It's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.95,0:34:54.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的所有职务将被撤销\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are removed from all your positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.37,0:34:55.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别 等等 等等 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,wait! Wait!Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.60,0:34:56.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向您发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.65,0:34:59.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以一切圣明发誓 那不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear by everything that's holy it's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.75,0:35:02.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对陛下赤胆忠心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty is held dear in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.13,0:35:06.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}密谋反对陛下 此乃叛国之罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is treason to plot against his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.47,0:35:08.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.16,0:35:09.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您到底什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.33,0:35:10.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人 等等 求您了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait your eminence,please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.53,0:35:11.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别这样对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.29,0:35:12.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您知道这不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know it's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.67,0:35:13.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求您了 主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eminence please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.90,0:35:15.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.10,0:35:17.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您知道这不是真的 主教大人 求您了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know it's not true, your eminence,please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.58,0:35:18.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求求您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.61,0:35:22.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的旗舰 玛丽-罗斯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is my flagship,the mary rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.53,0:35:25.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我旗下最庞大一艘战舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's the largest warship afloat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.48,0:35:31.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可运载重达七百吨 内置91樽大炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She displaces 700 tons,fires 91 guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.12,0:35:34.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及四百人的武装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and has a company of 400 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.35,0:35:39.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可没有这样的装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have nothing like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.88,0:35:43.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您有庞大的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have vast armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.52,0:35:48.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你我联手 所向无敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Together,we shall be invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.13,0:35:51.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国人怎能与我们匹敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How could the french withstand us?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.46,0:35:53.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有您与我并肩作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With you beside me,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.31,0:36:02.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有任何一个边界 前线 甚至是世界 是我们无法攻破的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there is no boundary or frontier or world we could not conquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.56,0:36:06.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经对您格外倾心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I like you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.26,0:36:13.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了我的下巴 还有什么不讨您的欢心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Except for the chin what is there not to like?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.73,0:36:25.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叛徒门 伦敦塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Traitor's gate tower of london
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.16,0:36:28.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}囚犯上岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Prisoner to the steps!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.34,0:36:36.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您一定要相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.94,0:36:37.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是无辜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm an innocent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.79,0:36:41.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道为什么会被带到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know why I've been brought here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.81,0:36:45.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是无辜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.44,0:36:47.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.15,0:36:48.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我什么也没有做错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've done nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.44,0:36:51.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有做过任何错事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've done nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.08,0:36:56.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要知道 你和我之间 被不可割断的纽带紧紧相连\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know,you and I are united by an indissoluble tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.86,0:37:02.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您娶了我母亲的妹妹 您就是我的叔父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since you married my mother's sister, you are really my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.46,0:37:11.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是段让我欣喜欢愉的连理 侄子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's an affinity which both delights and pleases me,nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.42,0:37:16.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下 您的阿姨正在等候您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your highness,your aunt awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.10,0:37:25.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣罗马帝国陛下 查尔斯皇帝殿下驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty,his imperial highness, charles,holy roman emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.61,0:37:49.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇后殿下 肯求您赐予我姨侄之间的祝福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty,I ask for your blessing, as a nephew to an aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.21,0:37:53.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的查尔斯 我所献给你的祝福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I give you my blessing freely,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.95,0:37:57.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将如我对你的爱一样滔滔不绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my dear charles as I give you my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.27,0:38:09.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下 请允许我向您介绍我的女儿玛丽 也就是您未来的新娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your highness,allow me to present my daughter mary,your future bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.67,0:38:14.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.23,0:38:16.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.29,0:38:21.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须经过等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.00,0:38:24.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才能结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.22,0:38:28.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为你能有足够的耐心吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think you have the patience?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.24,0:38:31.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我为殿下您准备了一份礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a present for your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.54,0:38:33.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您想看看吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you want to see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.23,0:38:35.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我喜欢礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.50,0:38:38.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.18,0:38:43.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那里 您看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.19,0:38:45.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些都是给我的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are they for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.62,0:38:47.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您喜欢吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.01,0:38:50.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它们是我得到的最好的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're the best presents I've ever had!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.30,0:38:53.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.75,0:39:20.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您二位可要尽早来探访我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As soon as possible, you must both come and visit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.34,0:39:25.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要带您欣赏英勇善战的征服者 阿兹特克族国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to show you especially the treasures of montezuma,king of the aztecs,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.29,0:39:30.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在墨西哥发掘的蒙特祖玛宝藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that general cortez recently discovered in mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.41,0:39:31.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们非常之乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.60,0:39:32.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.52,0:39:36.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于一海之隔的"印度" 我们也略有所闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've heard a little about the lands across the sea they call the indies.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.13,0:39:37.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我跟您说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.34,0:39:41.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我跟您发誓 那就是延续未来的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear to you, that is where the future lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.50,0:39:45.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大量未被开发的领土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So much undiscovered land.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.01,0:39:52.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无以计数的金银 矿物和盐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So much wealth of gold and silver, of minerals and salts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.91,0:40:03.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇后夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.08,0:40:16.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.62,0:40:20.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽量在他面前出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put yourself in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.79,0:40:26.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的备战准备得如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How are your preparations going?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.14,0:40:28.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们加大征召德国雇佣兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are recruiting more german mercenaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.55,0:40:32.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都算顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But everything is going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.95,0:40:35.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来年春天 我们将攻下米兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall take milan by next spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.99,0:40:37.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.61,0:40:39.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.26,0:40:42.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你我 将联军入侵法国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}together,we shall invade france
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.25,0:40:50.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}断送掉弗朗西斯国王的 放荡君主冒险之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and bring to an end the adventures of that libertine monarch,king francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.17,0:40:52.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那会让我欣喜若狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That will make me very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.33,0:40:56.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还会让您成为法国国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will also make you king of france!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.60,0:41:00.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.74,0:41:06.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精彩 精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bravo! Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.74,0:41:10.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再来一支舞 再来一支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Encore! Encore!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.18,0:41:14.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下 能否共舞？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you dance,your highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.65,0:41:18.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 当然还要经过陛下您的批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With your majesty's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.76,0:41:23.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.29,0:41:38.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.72,0:41:45.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说葡萄牙国王还有痛风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king of portugal, I've heard he also has gout.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.94,0:41:48.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人说他的脊椎已经变形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They say his spine is deformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.64,0:41:51.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走路好像螃蟹一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He walks like a crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.07,0:41:56.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇兄 请应承我一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Promise me something brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.81,0:42:00.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要我同意下嫁 有一个条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll agree to marry him on one condition:
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.90,0:42:08.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他死后… 反正也是不远的事 我的婚嫁对象将由我来选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When he's dead,which can't be long I can marry whom I choose!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.88,0:42:12.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您同意吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.51,0:42:22.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天不喝酒了吗 查尔斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not drinking today,charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.25,0:42:24.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还是该称你为大人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or should I say,your grace?!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.84,0:42:30.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看你还是称其本名 浪子或是流氓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should definitely call him by his real name which is cunt,or villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.27,0:42:31.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.72,0:42:35.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们本该是朋友 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're supposed to be friends,charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.96,0:42:37.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们现在不是朋友了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aren't we,still?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.57,0:42:39.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你不给我们少少好处 就没的朋友可做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not if you don't show us favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.51,0:42:42.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得到赏赐的你 有义务请求陛下赐予我们头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's within your gift to ask his majesty to give us some titles,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.71,0:42:44.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或至少封赏给我们些土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or at least some land.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.12,0:42:49.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来国王的赏赐 全部都落入了你的口袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seems everything the king has to give he's given to you already!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.80,0:42:52.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们嫉妒？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.51,0:42:54.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}理所应当的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.15,0:42:56.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你高升 我们也该高升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you rise,so too should we.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.99,0:43:01.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有什么能为您效劳的 大人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what can we do for you,your grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.63,0:43:05.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尊重我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show me some respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.96,0:43:12.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.94,0:43:16.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回到你的座位上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Back to your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.14,0:43:21.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能见到您我很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am so glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.95,0:43:24.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里总是一片寂寥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is often lonely here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.50,0:43:26.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}寂寥？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.55,0:43:28.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下和我之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Things are not well between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.37,0:43:30.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相处得并不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.50,0:43:32.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.38,0:43:37.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲眼看到他对您是多么的倾慕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw with my own eyes how attentive he is to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.34,0:43:41.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他看您的时候是如此全心投入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He looks at you with such,devotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.07,0:43:44.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此充满了爱意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems with such love.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.77,0:43:47.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕那是给您看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear that is for your benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.34,0:43:50.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利很会伪装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry is a good masquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.22,0:43:53.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别再让我听到你那番话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't want to hear this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.25,0:44:00.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安女士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady anne?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.83,0:44:03.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.07,0:44:08.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得 他终有一天会同我离婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think sometimes he will ask me for a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.88,0:44:11.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}离婚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A divorce!?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.32,0:44:15.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 那没可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.33,0:44:17.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.85,0:44:21.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.61,0:45:41.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.80,0:45:46.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.75,0:45:48.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那要怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.00,0:45:50.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}引诱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seduce me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.71,0:45:52.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}致我于书信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Write letters to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.16,0:45:54.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和诗词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And poems.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.33,0:45:55.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我热爱诗词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love poems.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.74,0:45:57.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用你的文字夺走我的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ravish me with your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.29,0:46:00.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}引诱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seduce me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.09,0:46:16.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.08,0:46:19.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.76,0:46:25.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.03,0:46:37.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}敬请两位陛下 以封印来见证两国所签订的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For your majesties to sign between you this treaty of perpetual amity and concord,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.14,0:46:40.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永久友好共处条约 并在此诸多王公贵族见证下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and to confirm with your seals and before these witnesses
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.91,0:46:44.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并认可 于玛丽公主殿下年长于12岁之际\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the betrothal of charles, holy roman emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.99,0:46:49.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下嫁于圣罗马帝国皇帝查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and her highness princess mary, upon her reaching the age of 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.80,0:46:53.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将以教廷使节 及英格兰 商议大臣的身份 再次向您们重申\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I say to you again,in my power as papal legate and chancellor of england,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.67,0:46:57.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您们将在这 验证彼此相敬相爱的合约上签字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you should sign this treaty of friendship,one to another,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.34,0:47:01.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永不毁约 愿上帝保佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and never break it,so help you god.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.16,0:47:36.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想您保证我对您的敬慕和忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear to you my honour and allegiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.93,0:47:40.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请您永远给予我于信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must always trust in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.54,0:47:43.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.87,0:47:47.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}佩斯先生呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is mr. Pace?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.09,0:47:48.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他应该参加才对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He should have been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.40,0:47:53.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我极为愧疚的发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty, I have discovered,shamefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.79,0:47:57.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}佩斯先生玷污了陛下您对他的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that mr.Pace was not deserving your majesty's trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.07,0:47:59.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经将他从职位上撤走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have removed him from his offices.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.31,0:48:02.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.22,0:48:07.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国人用重金将其收买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The french were paying him a pension.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.32,0:48:14.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.86,0:48:18.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信你能替我找人取而代之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trust you'll find me a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.80,0:48:24.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说 我们的事情进展如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well? How do our affairs proceed?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.33,0:48:26.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常顺利 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well,your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:29.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王还没有言明对她的倾心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king makes no obvious declaration of interest
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.89,0:48:32.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但通过他看她的眼神 可以洞察出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it's possible to detect it in the way he glances at her
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.05,0:48:37.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他的思绪中 他已对她的裸体垂涎许久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as if,in his mind,he could see her naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.36,0:48:39.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那倒是 但他看很多年轻女人都是用那种目光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,well,he looks at most young women that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.38,0:48:42.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这只是个开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it is a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.88,0:48:47.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}推倒那个 让人难以忍受的教士的一个开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A beginning at least to the end of that insufferable prelate.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.74,0:48:50.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时机刚刚好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All in good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.78,0:48:53.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切将接踵而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One thing will follow another.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.78,0:48:57.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许将萨福克公爵列入我们的计划中 也是个明智之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it would be a good idea to include the duke of suffolk in our plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.97,0:48:59.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯-布兰登 ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles brandon!?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.00,0:49:01.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他可不是什么君子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is barely a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.15,0:49:04.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是皇帝最亲近的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's the king's closest friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.51,0:49:07.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信他和我们一样憎恨沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I believe hates wolsey as much as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.23,0:49:10.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少在这多事之秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would be a natural ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.42,0:49:14.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大家都是同道中人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At least for a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.70,0:49:29.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}攻击得分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.35,0:49:32.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安东尼-墨尔本先生夺得两分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two points for mr.Anthony melbourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.45,0:49:51.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Heys,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.27,0:49:53.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要的你带来了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}do you have those pieces I asked for?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.97,0:49:56.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.59,0:50:03.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黄金镶边红宝石一枚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One,rubies set in circlets of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.84,0:50:08.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}镶于黄金与珍珠簇拥之下的 稀有宝石一枚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Second,a precious stone upon a bed of gold and pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.04,0:50:14.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带有黄金紫石及狮头装饰的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A third,small and large drops of pearl, with gold and purple
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.78,0:50:17.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什锦珍珠一幅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the detail of a lion's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.89,0:50:25.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后 由金银琥珀铸造的羽饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And lastly feathers of silver, gold and amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.97,0:50:30.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些珠宝很适合皇后殿下 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jewels fit for a queen,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.19,0:51:17.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was wolsey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.75,0:51:18.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was wolsey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.89,0:51:19.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.00,0:51:20.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.99,0:51:23.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收取法国人赃款的是沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's wolsey who has a pension from the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.27,0:51:24.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.34,0:51:25.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.03,0:51:25.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我什么都没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.91,0:51:26.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是无辜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.79,0:51:30.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是沃尔西 沃尔西 沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was wolsey! Wolsey! Wolsey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.30,0:51:31.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去质问他 质问他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just ask him! Ask him!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.91,0:51:34.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was wolsey!
